10px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display: flex;align-items: center;flex-shrink: 0;padding-right: 5px;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"flex-shrink: 0;padding-right: 5px;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"width: 6px;height: 6px;border-radius: 100%;background-color: #fef100;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%;border-top: 1px solid #f50c27;border-bottom: 1px solid #f50c27;height: 4px;box-sizing:border-box;max-width:100% !important;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<section data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%;height: 0px;box-sizing:border-box;max-width:100% !important;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"padding-top: 5px;padding-bottom: 5px;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section data-autoskip=\"1\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em; letter-spacing: 1.5px; background-color: transparent;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/1/images/cms/article/202501/%E5%9B%BD%E5%AE%B6%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E8%AE%BE%E6%96%BD%E5%BB%BA%E8%AE%BE%E6%8C%87%E5%BC%95.png\" style=\"width: 1007px; height: 708px;\" /></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p align=\"justify\" style=\"text-align:justify;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p align=\"justify\" style=\"text-align:justify;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"line-height: 115%; font-family: sans-serif;\">各省、自治区、直辖市及计划单列市、新疆生产建设兵团发展改革委、数据管理部门、工业和信息化主管部门、通信管理局：</span></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p align=\"justify\" style=\"text-align:justify;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p align=\"justify\" style=\"text-indent:20pt;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"line-height: 115%; font-family: sans-serif;\">为贯彻落实党的二十届三中全会关于建设和运营国家数据基础设施，促进数据共享的部署要求，国家发展改革委、国家数据局、工业和信息化部组织制定了《国家数据基础设施建设指引》。现印发给你们，请结合实际，因地制宜抓好落实。</span></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p align=\"justify\" style=\"text-align:justify;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p align=\"justify\" style=\"text-align:justify;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p align=\"right\" style=\"text-align:right;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"line-height: 115%; font-family: sans-serif;\">国家发展改革委</span></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p align=\"right\" style=\"text-align:right;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"line-height: 115%; font-family: sans-serif;\">国家数据局</span></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p align=\"right\" style=\"text-align:right;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"line-height: 115%; font-family: sans-serif;\">工业和信息化部</span></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p align=\"right\" style=\"text-align:right;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"line-height: 115%; font-family: sans-serif;\">2024年12月31日</span></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p align=\"right\" style=\"text-align:right;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p align=\"right\" style=\"text-align:right;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p align=\"right\" style=\"text-align:right;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"_135editor\" data-id=\"110073\" data-role=\"title\" data-tools=\"135编辑器\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"margin: 10px auto;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display: inline-block;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display: flex;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: flex-start;padding-right: 7px;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display: flex;flex-shrink: 0;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"width: 16px;height: 16px;background-color: #e00e0d;margin-top: 7px;margin-right: -9px;flex-shrink: 0;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t